  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "docket.tv | QA"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Investors don’t just want to understand *what* Docket.tv is—they want to quickly grasp **why it matters, why it’s valuable, and why you’re the right team to build it**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**1️⃣ What is Docket.tv? (The Elevator Pitch)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "👉 **Goal:** Investors want a **one-liner** that clearly states what Docket is and why it exists."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "💡 **Formula:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*\"Docket.tv is [what it is] that [solves a problem] for [who it helps] by [key differentiator].\"*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Example:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*\"Docket.tv is a next-gen content management and distribution platform for independent broadcasters and media organizations, streamlining scheduling, automation, and audience engagement in a way that traditional broadcast tools don’t.\"*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**2️⃣ What problem are you solving?**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "👉 **Goal:** Investors want to know if there’s **real pain** in the market."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "💡 **Formula:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*\"Right now, [specific audience] struggles with [major problem]. Existing solutions like [current alternatives] don’t work well because [why they fail]. Docket fixes this by [how we solve it better].\"*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Example:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*\"Right now, local broadcasters and independent media producers struggle with outdated, fragmented tools that make content scheduling and audience engagement a nightmare. Legacy systems like Cablecast and Vimeo Livestream are clunky, expensive, and not built for modern workflows. Docket simplifies this by providing an **end-to-end** platform that automates scheduling, streamlines content approvals, and integrates audience analytics—all in one place.\"*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**3️⃣ Why now? (Why is this the right time for Docket?)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "👉 **Goal:** Investors want to know if market conditions **favor your growth**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "💡 **Formula:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*\"The market is shifting because of [macro trend], and [existing solutions] aren’t built for this new reality. Docket is positioned to capitalize on [opportunity].\"*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Example:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*\"The media landscape is shifting—more local broadcasters, public access stations, and digital-first content creators need **simpler, cloud-based tools** to manage their workflows. The rise of decentralized and independent broadcasting means that legacy software is failing to keep up. **Docket is filling this gap** at the perfect time, as traditional broadcasters are modernizing and digital-first creators need scalable solutions.\"*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**4️⃣ How big is the market?**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "👉 **Goal:** Investors want to know if the opportunity is **big enough** to warrant investment."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "💡 **Formula:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*\"The total market for [industry] is [$X billion]. Within that, our target customers represent [$Y billion] of opportunity. If we capture just [small %], that’s a [$Z million] business.\"*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Example:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*\"The global broadcast technology market is valued at **$50B+**, with independent media and local stations representing a **$5B+ opportunity**. If Docket captures just **1% of this market**, we’re looking at a **$50M+ opportunity**—and that’s just the beginning, since more broadcasters are shifting to cloud-based operations.\"*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**5️⃣ How does Docket make money? (Business Model)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "👉 **Goal:** Investors want to see a **scalable, repeatable** revenue model."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "💡 **Formula:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*\"Docket operates on a [business model], where customers pay [pricing structure] to access [key value]. We also generate revenue from [additional revenue streams].\"*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-37",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Example:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*\"Docket operates on a **SaaS model**, where broadcasters and media organizations pay a **monthly subscription fee** based on their needs (e.g., content storage, automation, multi-channel distribution). We also have **transactional revenue** from premium automation tools, analytics, and integrations with external platforms.\"*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**6️⃣ Why will customers choose Docket over competitors?**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "👉 **Goal:** Investors want to know your **unique advantage**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "💡 **Formula:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*\"While [competitors] focus on [what they do], they fail at [where they fall short]. Docket is different because [our key differentiator].\"*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Example:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*\"Current solutions like Cablecast and Vimeo Livestream focus **only on video distribution**, but they fail at **workflow automation, scheduling, and collaboration**—which are the biggest pain points for broadcasters. Docket **combines content management, automation, and audience insights into one seamless platform**—making it the go-to solution for independent media organizations.\"*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**7️⃣ What’s your traction so far?**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "👉 **Goal:** Investors want **proof that people care about Docket**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "💡 **Formula:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*\"We’ve already seen strong traction, with [key milestones] such as [users, revenue, partnerships]. This validates that [the market wants our solution].\"*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Example:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*\"We’re currently in **active beta**, with [X] broadcasters already using Docket. We’ve onboarded [Y] shows and facilitated [Z] hours of scheduled programming. Our early users are actively engaging, and we’ve received **strong inbound interest** from additional broadcasters looking for better solutions.\"*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**8️⃣ What’s your go-to-market strategy?**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "👉 **Goal:** Investors want to know **how you’ll get customers efficiently**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-55",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-56",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "💡 **Formula:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-57",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*\"Our go-to-market strategy focuses on [main approach], leveraging [key channels] to reach [target customers].\"*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-58",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Example:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-59",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*\"We’re starting with **direct outreach to local broadcasters and media organizations**, leveraging **strategic partnerships** with community access stations. Our next step is scaling through **content partnerships, word-of-mouth referrals, and targeted industry marketing** to expand adoption.\"*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-60",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**9️⃣ What’s your long-term vision?**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-61",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "👉 **Goal:** Investors want to see if this can become **a huge company**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-62",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-63",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "💡 **Formula:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-64",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*\"In [X] years, Docket will [long-term vision], transforming [industry impact].\"*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-65",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Example:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-66",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*\"In five years, Docket will be the **operating system for independent broadcasting**, powering everything from scheduling to audience engagement across thousands of networks. Our goal is to become the **default platform for media organizations that need a modern, automated content management system**.\"*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-67",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**🔹 Final Thought: The “Rule of One”**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-68",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-69",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Whenever answering investor questions:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-73",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-70",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Stick to **ONE key message per answer**."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-71",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Keep each answer to **ONE minute or less**."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-72",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Highlight **ONE core insight that makes Docket stand out**."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}